WEBVTT

00:00:01.830 --> 00:00:03.750
The Witchblade...

00:00:03.830 --> 00:00:05.920
Some call it the weapon of God,

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.090
while others call it the hand of the Devil.

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:13.630
Men seek it, but are not allowed to possess it.

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:19.350
Women are bewitched by it, and charmed into battles.

00:00:19.430 --> 00:00:25.440
What awaits the one into whom fate is carved... is glory or destruction.

00:00:26.810 --> 00:00:31.150
At this moment, one woman stands at the edge of destiny.

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:49.560
Just before the shot, my chest feels like it's gonna tear open

00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:53.150
I shout out countless times, break out

00:00:53.290 --> 00:00:58.340
It's not over, rush through the endless night

00:01:00.050 --> 00:01:03.630
Hot blood flows through my body

00:01:03.950 --> 00:01:07.340
The moment it ultimately rots away

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:13.940
it's all over, fragments of an empty dream come to mind

00:01:14.410 --> 00:01:19.440
I can never go back, I can't remember a thing

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:24.980
I've been reduced to struggling, and my voice won't carry

00:01:25.120 --> 00:01:28.490
Uncontrollable impulses

00:01:28.510 --> 00:01:35.410
Give me your XTC, let me feel it one more time

00:01:35.420 --> 00:01:42.630
This body heats up, and I shout out your name in the darkness

00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:49.630
Give me your XTC, I don't need false love

00:01:49.650 --> 00:01:52.810
I will accept it, sin and punishment

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:59.380
Slash through the destiny I've been set up with, Blade

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:44.120
...up... Wake up... Come on.

00:02:44.440 --> 00:02:44.720
Mom, wake up!

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:49.500
"The Beginning"

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:51.330
Just a bit longer...

00:02:51.420 --> 00:02:53.630
Sheesh!

00:02:57.170 --> 00:02:59.460
Hey! Masane!

00:03:01.430 --> 00:03:07.760
Don't do that, Riko! I was feeling so good...

00:03:07.850 --> 00:03:10.560
You're the one who said to wake you up, Mom.

00:03:10.640 --> 00:03:12.520
Oh, you saw it?

00:03:12.600 --> 00:03:14.810
Uh-huh. Over there.

00:03:15.650 --> 00:03:17.020
Oh!

00:03:17.110 --> 00:03:19.570
It's just like the one we saw on TV!

00:03:19.650 --> 00:03:24.910
It wasn't an island six years ago.
The whole area was barren land!

00:03:24.990 --> 00:03:27.120
Hey, maybe we can see our house.

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:28.620
Watch out!

00:03:28.700 --> 00:03:31.790
Oh, don't worry. Huh? Ducks?

00:03:31.870 --> 00:03:32.660
Huh?

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:36.000
Oh, it got separated!
Watch out!

00:03:36.090 --> 00:03:41.720
Go over that way! Or you'll be
all alone! C'mon, hang in there!

00:03:45.970 --> 00:03:48.010
Doggy!

00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:49.810
What're you doing?!

00:03:51.350 --> 00:03:56.310
Oh, I'm so sorry! I was just...

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:59.780
Geez! What a way for a grown woman to act!

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:02.780
Who cares if a rubber ducky gets separated?!

00:04:02.860 --> 00:04:09.790
Well, I wouldn't call it a jinx,
but I just don't like things being alone.

00:04:09.870 --> 00:04:13.960
Like being separated, or left out...
Don't things like that bother you?

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:19.800
Not at all! Geez! Your kid is far more mature!

00:04:19.880 --> 00:04:25.590
Look! She's already trained that
stupid dog! She's somethin' else.

00:04:25.680 --> 00:04:28.890
Yeah, she's the one thing I can brag about.

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:32.520
I'm not surprised. Well, take good care of her.

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:36.600
We lost so many kids in the quake...

00:04:36.690 --> 00:04:41.570
Oh... the government established
some kind of department, right?

00:04:41.650 --> 00:04:45.740
The Department of Child
Welfare... It's just a sham.

00:04:45.820 --> 00:04:46.990
Mom!

00:04:47.070 --> 00:04:50.330
Did you dry your hair properly?
You don't want to catch a cold.

00:04:50.410 --> 00:04:54.620
Yes, I did, Princess Worrywart Rihoko.

00:04:54.710 --> 00:04:58.380
We're almost there.
You going to Tokyo for sightseeing?

00:04:58.460 --> 00:05:04.010
We're moving there. The two
of us are going to live in Tokyo.

00:05:04.090 --> 00:05:05.880
Right?

00:05:07.430 --> 00:05:10.720
Well, if you're going to live
in Tokyo, be very careful.

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:12.640
Right!

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:16.560
There's been a rash of
strange incidents lately.

00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:17.980
So watch yourself.

00:05:18.060 --> 00:05:21.610
Thanks, Mister! Here you are!

00:05:21.690 --> 00:05:26.610
You're missing one flag back there.
You can hoist this! It's all yours!

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:27.360
Hey!

00:05:27.410 --> 00:05:31.200
Bye-bye, Mister! Take care, doggy!

00:05:32.330 --> 00:05:33.790
Take care!

00:05:36.040 --> 00:05:37.960
Strange woman.

00:05:43.340 --> 00:05:45.260
They didn't have this before.

00:05:45.340 --> 00:05:48.680
So many people! Mom, don't get lost.

00:05:48.760 --> 00:05:51.350
That's my line to you!

00:05:51.430 --> 00:05:55.390
Oh, yeah! Let's decide on a
meeting place if we get separated!

00:05:56.640 --> 00:05:58.140
The Tokyo Tower!

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:00.900
Good thinking!

00:06:00.980 --> 00:06:04.610
If you get lost, let's meet
under the Tokyo Tower!

00:06:04.690 --> 00:06:05.360
Okay!

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:08.950
All right! First, let's go
find a job and a home!

00:06:18.750 --> 00:06:21.380
It's all right.

00:06:21.460 --> 00:06:24.130
Actually, let's satisfy our hunger first!

00:06:24.210 --> 00:06:28.260
And we'll splurge, in commemoration
of our first day in Tokyo! OK?!

00:06:28.340 --> 00:06:29.670
Yeah!

00:06:31.680 --> 00:06:34.430
Hey there.
You're late!

00:06:34.600 --> 00:06:37.970
And I thought this was
gonna be an easy job.

00:06:39.770 --> 00:06:41.690
It's the same method.

00:06:41.770 --> 00:06:47.320
Yeah. It's bad. We need a broom
and dustpan to pick up the pieces.

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:50.740
What does it take for
someone to do this?!

00:06:52.740 --> 00:06:57.370
Tozawa! Not you again!
Get lost, you hyena!

00:06:57.450 --> 00:06:59.040
Thanks a ton!

00:06:59.620 --> 00:07:01.080
What a haul!

00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:04.170
And now...

00:07:06.250 --> 00:07:07.800
Smells like a big scoop!

00:07:08.920 --> 00:07:14.930
That makes four Pulverizer Murders,
and at each one is a NSWF badge.

00:07:15.010 --> 00:07:18.350
Pretty sure they run
the Department of Child Welfare...

00:07:19.430 --> 00:07:21.600
Guess I'll dig around over there!

00:07:26.770 --> 00:07:29.570
Detective Nakata! Detective Nakata!

00:07:29.650 --> 00:07:31.320
Whaddya want?!

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:34.490
We spotted a suspicious fellow over there.

00:07:34.570 --> 00:07:37.330
Says he's the killer.
Not enough...

00:07:37.410 --> 00:07:40.500
That didn't satisfy me at all...

00:07:40.580 --> 00:07:44.420
He's probably just some drunk!
Don't keep sending them to me!

00:07:44.500 --> 00:07:47.960
Yes, sir. But what'll we do?
You guys handle it.

00:07:48.050 --> 00:07:49.500
Yes, sir!

00:07:49.590 --> 00:07:51.760
Hey, this way!
C'mon!

00:07:51.840 --> 00:07:57.720
I see. Keep your eyes on her.
If there's a chance, we'll make a move.

00:07:57.810 --> 00:07:58.930
Understood.

00:08:01.770 --> 00:08:04.020
Excuse me! May I ask you a question?

00:08:04.100 --> 00:08:05.480
What is it?

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:11.230
Did a woman with a child about
six years old get a ride on this boat?

00:08:11.320 --> 00:08:13.900
Err... yeah, they did.

00:08:13.990 --> 00:08:16.870
Seems like they did come to Tokyo.

00:08:16.950 --> 00:08:18.580
Did they say where they were going?

00:08:18.660 --> 00:08:22.330
Who're you people?
Did those two do something?

00:08:22.410 --> 00:08:26.630
No need to worry. We're on their side.

00:08:26.710 --> 00:08:29.170
I'm Sakurai with the
Department of Child Welfare.

00:08:33.510 --> 00:08:36.380
That was delicious! You're the best, Mister!

00:08:36.470 --> 00:08:37.180
Thanks!

00:08:37.220 --> 00:08:40.350
It's sorta unusual to make broth with bonito!

00:08:40.430 --> 00:08:41.680
Err... Yeah...

00:08:41.770 --> 00:08:43.140
Well, thanks for the food!

00:08:43.230 --> 00:08:46.730
I've been looking for you, Amaha Masane-san!

00:08:46.810 --> 00:08:48.650
Mom!
Let's get out of here!

00:08:54.150 --> 00:08:57.410
Amaha-san! If you keep
running away with Rihoko-Chan,

00:08:57.490 --> 00:09:01.910
you'll be charged with kidnapping
by the new child welfare laws!

00:09:01.990 --> 00:09:03.330
What?!

00:09:03.410 --> 00:09:05.500
Like I've explained time and time again,

00:09:05.580 --> 00:09:08.250
if a child doesn't have the proper
environment to grow up in,

00:09:08.330 --> 00:09:12.840
the Dept. of Child Welfare will take
custody of the child. It's the law!

00:09:12.920 --> 00:09:15.300
Right now, you have no income, no home

00:09:15.380 --> 00:09:17.220
You kicked us out!

00:09:17.300 --> 00:09:20.640
You're only allowed to live
at the domestic shelter for six years.

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:22.680
Rihoko and I are determined to work it out!

00:09:22.770 --> 00:09:24.810
Rihoko-Chan is only six years old!

00:09:24.890 --> 00:09:31.610
I can help my mom! She can't
even cook, so I have to be with her!

00:09:31.690 --> 00:09:35.150
So please! Let me stay with my mom!

00:09:35.240 --> 00:09:40.280
Rihoko-Chan, could I talk
to your mom alone for a minute?

00:09:43.160 --> 00:09:47.750
I'm her mother... Why can't I live with her?

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:52.170
You've really changed, Amaha-san.

00:09:57.720 --> 00:09:59.510
On that day six years ago,

00:09:59.590 --> 00:10:05.770
you and Rihoko-Chan were
miraculously saved at Naru Point.

00:10:05.850 --> 00:10:09.440
But when you awoke, you had
completely lost your memory.

00:10:09.520 --> 00:10:12.150
You couldn't even remember your own name.

00:10:12.230 --> 00:10:14.650
And no one would've known you
were her mother had it not been

00:10:14.730 --> 00:10:16.860
for your maternity record book.

00:10:18.820 --> 00:10:21.870
When you first came to the center,
you told your counselor

00:10:21.950 --> 00:10:25.160
you couldn't feel anything
maternal towards Rihoko-Chan.

00:10:25.240 --> 00:10:26.660
That's !

00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:29.370
It's only natural,
since you had lost your memory.

00:10:29.460 --> 00:10:32.380
That's not it! I may
have felt that at the time...

00:10:32.460 --> 00:10:35.210
But now we're a close family of two!

00:10:35.300 --> 00:10:41.260
Then you must think hard about
what is best for Rihoko-Chan.

00:10:41.340 --> 00:10:43.220
Do you realize how detrimental it is

00:10:43.300 --> 00:10:46.180
for a young child to live
each day in uncertainty?

00:10:46.270 --> 00:10:49.600
Can you afford a doctor if she gets sick?

00:10:49.690 --> 00:10:51.940
It's true that right now I...

00:10:52.020 --> 00:10:57.980
The Dept. of Child Welfare can
provide her a nurturing environment.

00:10:58.070 --> 00:11:01.700
There's even a hospital, and a kindergarten.

00:11:01.780 --> 00:11:04.450
Which is better for her happiness?

00:11:04.530 --> 00:11:06.620
If you're her mother, you know the answer.

00:11:08.290 --> 00:11:11.120
When the department feels
you're capable of providing for her,

00:11:11.210 --> 00:11:13.210
you can live together again.

00:11:18.550 --> 00:11:21.470
Well then, Rihoko-Chan! Let's go!

00:11:21.550 --> 00:11:24.050
What about my mom?
She says she's not coming.

00:11:24.140 --> 00:11:26.600
You're lying!
She says to come with me.

00:11:26.680 --> 00:11:31.310
No! Mom! I want to live with you! Mom!

00:11:31.390 --> 00:11:33.980
Mom! Please! I can cook!
And I promise I'll wake you up nicely

00:11:34.060 --> 00:11:39.320
Let's go. New friends are waiting!
Please! Let me stay!

00:11:39.400 --> 00:11:41.820
Mom!

00:11:42.910 --> 00:11:43.860
No!

00:11:45.660 --> 00:11:47.490
Do you need an escort?

00:11:47.580 --> 00:11:49.450
Mom!
No, that won't be necessary.

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:52.620
Riko!
Hey!

00:11:52.710 --> 00:11:54.170
Mom! Mom!

00:11:54.250 --> 00:11:55.710
Start the car! Quickly!

00:11:55.790 --> 00:11:57.380
Stop! What're you doing!

00:11:58.800 --> 00:12:11.600
Mom!

00:12:11.680 --> 00:12:13.600
It's just for a while!
Let go of me!

00:12:13.690 --> 00:12:17.110
You're not being separated forever. Stop it!

00:12:17.190 --> 00:12:20.690
You wouldn't understand how a mother feels!

00:12:30.240 --> 00:12:32.750
Let me out! Let me out! Let me out!

00:12:32.830 --> 00:12:35.710
Rihoko-Chan, you'll be able
to live with your mom someday.

00:12:35.790 --> 00:12:38.880
You wouldn't understand how I feel!

00:12:41.960 --> 00:12:42.920
Riko!

00:12:43.010 --> 00:12:45.340
Mom!
Unbelievable!

00:12:47.640 --> 00:12:49.470
Stealing a police car!

00:12:49.560 --> 00:12:52.720
We can't let a mother
like that have her child back!

00:12:54.640 --> 00:12:55.730
Stop the car!

00:12:57.900 --> 00:12:58.940
Wha ?!

00:13:34.680 --> 00:13:37.100
Alright! Gotcha!

00:13:38.310 --> 00:13:41.770
The sun's about to set. Maybe I'll drop by...

00:13:53.700 --> 00:14:03.800
Riko... I'm so sorry
for leaving you all alone...

00:14:04.880 --> 00:14:09.340
Isn't that great, Rihoko-Chan?
Your mother wasn't hurt!

00:14:09.430 --> 00:14:13.350
But stealing a police car...
That was a bad thing for her to do.

00:14:13.430 --> 00:14:16.600
Pee.
Eh? Oh.

00:14:17.600 --> 00:14:20.600
You don't need to hurry.
Okay.

00:14:29.110 --> 00:14:33.910
Damn... This smell is too much...

00:14:33.990 --> 00:14:36.660
And it's first-rate!

00:14:57.770 --> 00:14:59.060
Oww!

00:15:00.230 --> 00:15:02.150
What the hell?!

00:15:02.230 --> 00:15:05.650
I'm sorry! Are you all right?!

00:15:07.740 --> 00:15:08.990
Oh, crap!

00:15:11.700 --> 00:15:15.780
It works! This thing is my life, you know!

00:15:15.870 --> 00:15:18.410
I'm sorry, but do you have a car?!

00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:19.910
Huh? Yeah.

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:22.250
Rihoko-Chan!

00:15:22.330 --> 00:15:24.380
Where are you?!

00:15:24.460 --> 00:15:27.840
You Rihoko?
Rihoko-Chan!

00:15:27.840 --> 00:15:29.260
Please help me escape!
Rihoko-Chan!

00:15:29.340 --> 00:15:30.300
Eh?!
Are you all right?!

00:15:30.380 --> 00:15:31.880
I want to save my mom!

00:15:31.970 --> 00:15:34.800
Yeah, right! If I run off with a kid...

00:15:34.890 --> 00:15:37.310
Is something the matter, Sakurai-san?!

00:15:37.390 --> 00:15:40.600
I can't find a little girl!
Could she be down below?

00:15:40.680 --> 00:15:42.270
Damn!

00:15:46.400 --> 00:15:47.610
Hey!

00:15:47.690 --> 00:15:49.730
Is someone there?!

00:15:57.740 --> 00:16:00.620
So? Where's your mom?

00:16:00.700 --> 00:16:03.040
South Asagaya Detention Center.

00:16:08.420 --> 00:16:12.010
Do you not know where it is?

00:16:12.090 --> 00:16:15.680
Lemme think for a sec...

00:16:15.760 --> 00:16:17.680
Boy, did I pick up a winner...

00:16:20.350 --> 00:16:24.270
That glow in my hand is gone...

00:17:00.180 --> 00:17:02.270
What's wrong?!

00:17:02.350 --> 00:17:08.100
The cop car thief is in pain.
We may need an ambulance.

00:17:08.190 --> 00:17:10.730
Confirm first.
Roger that.

00:17:10.820 --> 00:17:12.730
Hey, are you okay?!

00:17:25.830 --> 00:17:27.250
A monster!

00:17:28.750 --> 00:17:31.790
That's nothing to me.
Dammit!

00:17:40.720 --> 00:17:42.350
See ya!

00:17:48.770 --> 00:17:50.900
We're here.
I'll come, too!

00:17:50.980 --> 00:17:53.610
Forget it! You wait here!

00:17:53.690 --> 00:17:59.360
I'll go check things out.
You got a photo or anything?

00:17:59.450 --> 00:18:01.490
Of your mom.

00:18:08.620 --> 00:18:13.420
So you're the one that smells so great!

00:18:13.500 --> 00:18:19.430
It's gonna feel so good to smash you into bits!

00:18:23.140 --> 00:18:25.180
Don't run away...

00:18:27.850 --> 00:18:32.610
Here it comes! Bang bang! Bam bam!

00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:36.190
Over here?!
What the hell?!

00:18:36.280 --> 00:18:37.820
Die!

00:18:39.280 --> 00:18:45.080
Nobody can interrupt now.
Let's have some real fun together...

00:18:54.590 --> 00:19:01.470
I can finally smash you!
I can't wait to hear the sound!

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:33.750
What the ?! You're with the NSWF!
No wonder you smell so

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:42.130
You're the greatest!
This time, I'll get you in one blow!

00:19:45.100 --> 00:19:47.470
You're not enough for me.

00:19:55.730 --> 00:19:57.480
Hey, I'm not

00:20:13.870 --> 00:20:15.710
What is that?!

00:20:15.790 --> 00:20:18.840
Hey! What're you doing there?
Crap!

00:20:22.340 --> 00:20:24.720
And... cut!

00:20:24.800 --> 00:20:28.800
Now then. Guess I'll collect this one.

00:20:31.560 --> 00:20:32.520
Riko!

00:20:35.940 --> 00:20:37.650
Mom...

00:20:40.070 --> 00:20:42.740
The recovery team will take care of the X-Con,

00:20:42.820 --> 00:20:45.150
but what about my video data?

00:20:45.240 --> 00:20:50.580
I got it. It's the Witchblade
wearer, no mistake about it.

00:20:50.660 --> 00:20:54.580
I shot her with a tranquilizer,
so we'll be able to get her shortly.

00:20:54.670 --> 00:20:57.460
I'm looking forward to it.
Understood.

00:21:00.710 --> 00:21:02.760
Why now?

00:21:20.940 --> 00:21:27.660
Riko...

00:21:30.740 --> 00:21:34.330
I'm coming...

00:21:37.080 --> 00:21:39.630
Ri... ko...

00:21:57.190 --> 00:22:07.280
I murmur, "I love you," with all my emotion

00:22:07.360 --> 00:22:16.620
All my feelings until yesterday now overflow and dissolve quickly

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:28.550
If only this one last prayer could make it through...

00:22:28.630 --> 00:22:37.390
Thank you for giving us the words to ascertain each other, God

00:22:39.060 --> 00:22:49.400
Tomorrow, we'll reach out and hold hands harder than normal

00:22:49.490 --> 00:23:02.420
Tomorrow, we'll reach out, hug, kiss, and love each other

00:23:12.970 --> 00:23:17.930
Getting separated the moment
we arrive in Tokyo is the pits!

00:23:18.020 --> 00:23:19.600
How are you doing?

00:23:19.680 --> 00:23:22.480
Don't follow any strangers, now!

00:23:22.560 --> 00:23:26.440
I don't know where I am...

00:23:26.530 --> 00:23:29.650
and I don't know what's happening to me.

00:23:29.740 --> 00:23:33.320
All I know is I've met an aggravating man.

00:23:33.410 --> 00:23:35.660
I'll get out of here somehow.

00:23:35.740 --> 00:23:36.830
So wait for me, OK?
